extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NYxz3hMAcGsQ7kNvwG6LCpN&_nc_oc=AdrPD7f4j6CGqH60PEcKeftWQ-zuSEc5-v11V3M6xkPxW_P40a50aF4dp4oSYnzuaRY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ27Ej1tW_NxeexEcQk29CecMyTHLxGU5l6O7KkVRR99A&oe=6AE9FBD6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NT7MvwGLPfUQ7kNvwFbKxC6&_nc_oc=Ado6y9fgJiWcn1m0AJyCamgt03yVS6mrEFEYWoJhN5dcn026UNSrM1kQHqn1GJFC1OM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2m73GMl8iwvbYgsKCyy6BG-6ndpkn3Et060Pa9B_nXA&oe=6AEA0322"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kqQ9CT1jFzgQ7kNvwEnVJhd&_nc_oc=AdpHd1HM3Y22WYxowgendIr3cbPTFBEZ5_fymfTaP778zwhG8WjguqZBzyjRNHx77ig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRDMK5EN3V6dkKJ3W91Yh1RUqxZ34YdLltNe6gA_zgxVA&oe=6AEA0B19"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":